{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mace Knight demo contains the first area of the game, including 4 levels, 1 boss, and an endless mode. The full game will feature more areas, more enemies, and more maces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line 'em up and bring the pain in this action-packed arcade game. Grab your mace of choice, bash your way through hordes of enemies, and compete for the top score on the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mace</strong> - This weapon forces you to navigate around enemies, thinking through each encounter in a unique way. Get into position and then yank the mace across the screen, hitting enemies in the process.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable knight</strong> - Swap between different helmets and maces, each with their own unique abilities. Experiment with different combinations and learn what best suits your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> - Compete with friends and strangers as you strive to become  master of the mace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original chiptune soundtrack</strong> by AlmostCosmic97</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Only the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928590/27a1d12282265c25c73ab4a8cdb12f47c0b56dbb.jpg"},{"name":"I \u2764\ufe0f maces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928590/8efc14c218dcf9c74585a75858b0ad8d04b65d36.jpg"},{"name":"Time for a new look!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928590/42a3a08bb5a3f2cc6bbae9743116227b34f56a0b.jpg"},{"name":"Having a ruff time?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928590/67ddd5e9c011015022e2dd50205be9a7c4330e15.jpg"},{"name":"